# Intentionally empty.
#
# DO NOT add `/author  /author.html  301` here. It looks harmless and it is not:
# wrangler.toml sets `html_handling = "auto-trailing-slash"`, which already
# serves author.html at /author AND redirects /author.html -> /author. Adding a
# rule pointing the other way produces an infinite 307/301 ping-pong and the
# browser fails with ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS. That shipped once.
#
# Extension-less URLs are handled by html_handling, not by this file. If you
# need a genuine redirect (a renamed page, an external link), it goes here — but
# check it does not fight the extension stripping first, with:
#
#   npm run build && npx wrangler dev --local
#   curl -sI localhost:8787/whatever
